# ============================================================ 只收代码
# 目标：源码 + 配置进仓库；几何、数据、二进制、缓存一律不进。

# ---- CAD 几何（"图"）----------------------------------------
*.SLDPRT
*.SLDASM
*.SLDDRW
*.sldprt
*.sldasm
*.slddrw
*.fwp
*.3DXML
*.stp
*.step
*.igs
*.iges
*.x_t
*.x_b

# ---- SolidWorks 残留锁文件 ----------------------------------
~$*

# ---- 二进制 / 编译产物 --------------------------------------
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.obj
*.tmp
*.docx
*_project_folders.html

# ---- 缓存 ---------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
$rpr_data/

# ---- 每次跑出来的数据（CAD 副本 / Flow 工程 / 训练表）-------
